# A recipe's card, and its Edit screen
// The card:  its picture, how many it's for, its ingredients to pick, and its numbered steps.
// The Edit screen changes a draft:  nothing changes until Save.

a recipe
	its "picked count" is the length of (ingredients in its ingredients where its picked is yes)

	to pick it
		// Its card, in place of whatever was showing
		set the chosen of recipe cards to it
		set the editing of recipe cards to nothing

	to "edit" with icon "pencil"
		// Its Edit screen
		set the editing of recipe cards to it

	to "add the picked to the shopping list" with title "Add to shopping list", icon "cart plus"
		// Each picked ingredient, for how many are eating, onto Shopping List's list;  the same thing in the same unit adds up
		set dish to its title
		for ingredient in its ingredients
			if the ingredient's picked is yes
				set measure to the ingredient's shown
				set same to the first item in (every item where its got is no) where its name is the ingredient's name and its unit is measure's unit
				if same exists
					set same's amount to same's amount + measure's number
				otherwise
					add (a new item with name = the ingredient's name, amount = measure's number, unit = measure's unit, aisle = the ingredient's aisle, recipe = dish) to the items
				set the ingredient's picked to no

	to draw it
		<card fluid class="recipe">
			<if its picture is not "">
				<image src={its picture} alt={its title} aspect-ratio="21:9" crop />
			</if>
			<content>
				<stack>
					<stack direction="horizontal" justify="between">
						<header size="large">{its title}</header>
						<action "edit" />
					</stack>
					<text color="grey">The recipe is for {its serves} people.  These amounts are for the {the diners of recipe cards} you're cooking for.</text>
					<header size="small">Ingredients</header>
					<stack spacing="xs">
						<for ingredient in its ingredients />
					</stack>
					<stack direction="horizontal">
						<button color="primary" icon="cart plus" disabled={its picked count is 0} onClick={add the picked to the shopping list}>
							Add {its picked count} ticked items to the shopping list
						</button>
					</stack>
					<header size="small">Steps</header>
					{draw the steps of it}
				</stack>
			</content>
		</card>

	to draw its steps
		// Each step with its number
		<stack spacing="sm">
			{draw the numbered steps of it}
		</stack>

	to draw its numbered steps
		for step, place in its steps
			<stack direction="horizontal" spacing="sm" align="start" class="step">
				<label circular size="small">{place}</label>
				<text>{the step's instruction}</text>
			</stack>
